---
// The tutor answers with a question instead of the answer.
---

<div class="art">
  <p class="student"><span class="sr-only">Student: </span>So x = 4, right? Just tell me.</p>
  <p class="tutor"><span class="sr-only">Tutor: </span>What happens if you divide both sides of 3x = 12 by 3?</p>
  <p class="tag">vllm serve · 1× GPU</p>
</div>

<style>
  .art {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    height: 100%;
    padding: 24px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  p {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .student {
    align-self: flex-end;
    max-width: 80%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .tutor {
    align-self: flex-start;
    max-width: 85%;
    border: 1px solid rgb(181 140 255 / 0.65);
    background: rgb(181 140 255 / 0.12);
  }
  .tag {
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--faint);
    font: 12px var(--mono);
  }
</style>
